OL,3,GNEWSAMicrosoft says email queues
OL,4,A'approaching normal levels' after
OL,5,Aglobal outage hits Outlook and Teams
OL,6,Ausers
OL,7,
OL,8,FMicrosoft says it's seeing "encouraging
OL,9,Frecovery progress", and is focusing on
OL,10,F"addressing residual impact", after a
OL,11,Fglobal outage hit Teams, Outlook and AI
OL,12,Fsoftware Copilot
OL,14,FThe company says there's no evidence of
OL,15,F"malicious activity". Earlier it warned
OL,16,Fof "intermittent access issues" for
OL,17,Fsome users - more than 20 hours after
OL,18,Fthe outage began, our tech reporter
OL,19,Fexplains the glitches your inbox may
OL,20,Fstill be experiencing
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,419,410,260,120,0,100
